description:
Build the story page template to the Story artboard (round 2, https://claude.ai/artifact/EoXGtpzsayij4d7tmrfZ9r), so trend stories have somewhere to land. Round 3 doesn't change this page.

The page:
- headline and standfirst;
- a figure drawn from map data, with caption and credit;
- the provenance trail ("Drafted by AI · N readers steered it · Approved by ‹handle› · DATE");
- body text with numbered citations to signals and concept chips;
- a "What this changes on the map" box;
- "Was this story right?" with up/down votes and "This is wrong";
- signals cited, concepts in the story, and related stories.

Until AI trend stories exist (ship-2fd025), use one tagged sample story, and keep the vote controls as placeholders until voting on stories exists (ship-15b04c). Start after Phase 1 (ship-573e70).

Acceptance: the sample story page matches the artboard in light and dark at 1440 and 390, and every placeholder is tagged.
